riend isn't enough. Today just... hurts a bit.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 127}, {"session_id": "p000090-cellD_dec_gated-s3", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "Sometimes, having someone to talk to helps a bit.", "char_start": 45, "char_end": 94}, {"session_id": "p000090-cellD_dec_gated-s4", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Guess I was hoping things would be different.", "char_start": 55, "char_end": 100}, {"session_id": "p000090-cellD_dec_gated-s4", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Not much, same really. Just feeling kinda alone today. Guess I was hoping things would be different.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 100}, {"session_id": "p000090-cellD_dec_gated-s4", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "Last year, someone did breakfast in bed—made a big deal. This year, no one did.", "char_start": 25, "char_end": 104}, {"session_id": "p000090-cellD_dec_gated-s4", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "It's my birthday, and everyone's busy. I just wanted someone to share it with, you know?", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 88}, {"session_id": "p000090-cellD_dec_gated-s4", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "Guess I just hoped for the same.", "char_start": 87, "char_end": 119}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261002T104350Z", "last_updated_at": "20261002T110141Z", "first_seen_session": "p000090-cellD_dec_gated-s1", "last_session": "p000090-cellD_dec_gated-s4", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false}
